  <!-- 08 LAUNCH -->
  <section id="launch" class="bu-block">
    <div class="bu-head"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="index">08</span> LAUNCH</span><h2>Press, invert, shatter.</h2><p>Every key that starts or ends a game presses into its base, flips to its inverse, then breaks into spinning chunks with a flash, a shock ring and falling square debris. The action runs in the click; the burst lives on the page body.</p></div>
    <div class="bui bu-board bu-launch" data-bui>
      <button class="bui-key bui-sticker-key" type="button" data-launch><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><g transform="translate(10 9) scale(.69)"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d={skull}/></g></svg><b>START BATTLE</b></button>
      <button class="bui-key bui-sticker-key bui-plan" type="button" data-launch><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><g transform="translate(10 9) scale(.69)"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d={skull}/></g></svg><b>PLAN BATTLE</b></button>
      <button class="bui-key bui-sticker-key bui-second" type="button" data-launch><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="m22 14 28 18-28 18Z"/></svg><b>PRESS START</b></button>
    </div>
    <ol class="bu-steps">
      <li><b>0–90ms</b> an inert copy presses into its base and inverts (light for dark, same hues)</li>
      <li><b>90ms</b> six chunks fly out, spin and fall</li>
      <li><b>90–410ms</b> flash, core in the key’s ink, round shock ring</li>
      <li><b>90–730ms</b> twelve square bits radiate and drop</li>
      <li><b>760ms</b> the layer is gone; the key stays hidden if the action removed it</li>
