    <div class="bu-head"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="index">09</span> COMMS &amp; TIPS</span><h2>Say it once, where it reads.</h2><p>One comms line carries every explanation. It never sits under the header or slides under a card. Button tips dim the page and ring each group's keys.</p></div>
    <div class="bui bu-board bu-comms" data-bui>
      <p class="bui-toast">Tank 2: tap a square to send it, or Attack HQ.</p>
      <div class="bu-tip"><button class="bui-tip-label" type="button">Squad: fall in · repair · advance · attack</button><span class="bui-tip-ring"><span class="bu-keys"><button class="bui-key bui-arcade bui-fallin" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Fall in"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d={icon.fallin}/></svg></button><button class="bui-key bui-arcade bui-retreat" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Retreat"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d={icon.retreat}/></svg></button><button class="bui-key bui-arcade bui-attack" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Attack"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d={icon.attack}/></svg></button></span></span></div>
